<title>POLAND: BUDIMEX NOV NET RISES TO PLN 1.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>BUDIMEX NOV NET RISES TO PLN 1.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results November</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.21 vs   1.05</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.21 vs   1.05</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.86 vs   0.27</p>
<p> Sales		   27.60 vs  29.43</p>
<p>JANUARY-NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	    16.97 vs  18.68</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	17.44 vs  18.80</p>
<p> Operating profit     8.52 vs  13.84</p>
<p> Sales		  245.46 vs 248.28</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish construction firm is Budimex SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
